    "title": "<p>Immunophenotype of T-lymphoblastic leukaemia/lymphoma (T-ALL/LBL) and stages of intrathymic differentiation {31567129; 28538509; 26991119; 19147408}</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Judith A. Ferry",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.25pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Intrathymic stage</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Immunophenotype<sup>a</sup></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 184.25pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"246\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Comments</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pro-T</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">cCD3+, CD7+, CD2&minus;, CD5&minus;, CD1a&minus;, CD4&minus;, CD8&minus;, CD34+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 184.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"246\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pre-T</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">cCD3+, CD7+, CD2+, CD5+/&minus;, CD1a&minus;, CD4&minus;, CD8&minus;, CD34+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 184.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"246\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Cortical T</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">cCD3+, CD7+, CD2+, CD1a+, CD4+, CD8+, CD34&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 184.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"246\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Most common immunophenotype for T-ALL/LBL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Medullary T</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">cCD3+, sCD3+, CD7+, CD2+, CD1a&minus;, CD4 or CD8+, CD34&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 184.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"246\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.25pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Early T-precursor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD1a&minus;, CD8&minus;</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD5&minus; or expressed by &lt;&nbsp;75% of blasts</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&ge;&nbsp;1&nbsp;myeloid or stem cell antigen expressed by &ge;&nbsp;25% of blasts (CD11b, CD13, CD33, CD34, CD65, KIT [CD117], HLA-DR)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 184.25pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"246\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Corresponds to some cases with pro-T or pre-T immunophenotype</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>The immunophenotype of neoplastic cells may deviate from the normal T-cell maturation pattern.</p>",
